category: Libs
requires: libeasyfc-devel libeasyfc-gobject0 libglib2.0-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "Easy configuration generator interface for fontconfig (development / GObject)"
ldesc: "libeasyfc is an interface library to generate fontconfig configuration for
user preferences. this supports to assign your preferrable fonts to the alias
fonts, such as sans-serif, serif and monospace per languages."
external-source: libeasyfc

